==Battleground==
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 1.67~2 seconds<sup>50f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If the player doesn't have good defense units, the Shy Boys can knock down the Cat Base. Be sure to have enough income and spawn [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating cats]] like [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]], or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and start spamming meatshields ([[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], etc.) and other units. If possible use the [[Cap'n Ahab (Combo)|Cap'n Ahab]] Combo ([[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Fortune Teller Cat (Rare Cat)|Fisherman Cat]]) to increase base health. You can try to increase your wallet while trying to kill the Shy Boys for more money to be able to spawn Bahamut Cat or other attackers. Immediately start spamming meatshields after the Shy Boys are killed, and use attackers to knockback Bun Bun and continue the meatshield spam.

You can also use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] to one shot the Shy Boys for max wallet at the beginning, as well as being able to do massive damage when fighting the Teacher Bun Bun.

